title Hora y fecha
status rgslide-ctl status time
run|Sincronizar con internet|rgslide-ctl time sync
run|Adelantar 1 hora|rgslide-ctl time adjust +60
run|Atrasar 1 hora|rgslide-ctl time adjust -60
run|Adelantar 10 minutos|rgslide-ctl time adjust +10
run|Atrasar 10 minutos|rgslide-ctl time adjust -10
choice|Zona horaria|rgslide-ctl time zone|rgslide-ctl time tz %s|Europe/Madrid,Atlantic/Canary,UTC,America/Mexico_City,America/Bogota,America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires,America/New_York
